  "code" : "public int lengthOfLIS(int[] nums) {\n    int[] tails = new int[nums.length];\n    int size = 0;\n    for (int x : nums) {\n        int lo = 0, hi = size;\n        while (lo < hi) {\n            int mid = (lo + hi) >>> 1;\n            if (tails[mid] < x) lo = mid + 1;\n            else hi = mid;\n        }\n        tails[lo] = x;\n        if (lo == size) size++;\n    }\n    return size;\n}",
